<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/>*<sp/>Callback<sp/>function<sp/>used<sp/>to<sp/>handle<sp/>window<sp/>resizing.</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/>*<sp/></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/>*<sp/>@param[in]<sp/>width<sp/>The<sp/>new<sp/>width<sp/>of<sp/>the<sp/>window.</highlight></codeline>
